{"id":"7827d9c0c0601daf61791e7aa35d5e9641a78321","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1252124","title":"GPT 懂装不懂， Cursor (Grok)不懂装懂， Gemini 啥也不是","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"KentonMercer","excerpt":"程序员 - @KentonMercer -","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Main\">\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18225342\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/ee6c9816fbec254923471fc2c30a6073?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"qwzhang01\" data-uid=\"339101\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/qwzhang01\">qwzhang01</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-27 12:18:17 +08:00\">15h 19m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我买的 800 多的 cursor ，现在不能用 Claude 了，八嘎</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18225666\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/3d96ba6a8634ca58396f2562c553ee0f?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"Cyanopica\" data-uid=\"551009\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>4</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Cyanopica\">Cyanopica</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>PRO</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-27 13:41:12 +08:00\">13h 56m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/qwzhang01\">qwzhang01</a> 以前 20 刀的 Cursor 套餐内还能用一点 Claude （虽然计费以后量很少），现在 30 刀的 Cursor 联合会员都不能套餐内用 Claude 了，8 刀的联合会员更是残废，只能用 Grok4.6/4.7 Medium 和 Composer2.5 。后悔上一轮 Cursor 没有续费，现在不能续费旧的方案了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18228102\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/8f2759b68b20ddbba243c0c9a162f3d4?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"bunny189\" data-uid=\"352277\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>5</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/bunny189\">bunny189</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-27 23:15:14 +08:00\">4h 22m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>grok 哥：还在报错是因为 debug 开着，我把 debug 关了，现在就不会报错了！</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n\n</div></DIV>","content_text":"3 qwzhang01 15h 19m ago 我买的 800 多的 cursor ，现在不能用 Claude 了，八嘎 4 Cyanopica PRO 13h 56m ago @qwzhang01 以前 20 刀的 Cursor 套餐内还能用一点 Claude （虽然计费以后量很少），现在 30 刀的 Cursor 联合会员都不能套餐内用 Claude 了，8 刀的联合会员更是残废，只能用 Grok4.6/4.7 Medium 和 Composer2.5 。后悔上一轮 Cursor 没有续费，现在不能续费旧的方案了 5 bunny189 4h 22m ago via iPhone grok 哥：还在报错是因为 debug 开着，我把 debug 关了，现在就不会报错了！","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T19:40:00.133Z","ok":true}